WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:04.208
People die every day.

00:00:04.917 --> 00:00:06.500
Why not give nature a helping hand?

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.250
It's just prime for, for funny you know.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.959
I mean, these are normal women doing something mad.

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:15.750
And with no skill set.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.834
Right, it's like the most ridiculous thing.

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:23.166
It's a comedy and it's a drama.

00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:24.625
Set and shot in Ireland.

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:26.959
Essentially it's a story of a family of sisters.

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:32.333
One of them, Grace, is married to a diabolical,
terrible human.

00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:35.542
Break these in for me will you? Just,
wear them round the house.

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:39.750
Her sisters can see that they're losing her and
if they don't do something soon,

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:40.709
she's going to be gone.

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:43.583
So they decide to try and kill him.

00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:50.125
The connections between the five of
them, is really endlessly entertaining.

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:52.041
I think for anyone who has siblings,

00:00:52.041 --> 00:00:55.750
there's going to be lots of things that
resonate and are painful and funny.

00:00:55.792 --> 00:00:57.083
So you go everywhere together?

00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:58.375
Well, we're close.

00:00:58.542 --> 00:00:59.583
Like a pack.

00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:01.208
Like a family.

00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:05.166
Eva is the matriarch.

00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:07.333
Their parents died when they were young.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.583
She decided she'd look out for the girls.

00:01:09.709 --> 00:01:11.041
And sort of parked her life.

00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:14.875
Bibi would be the meticulous planner.

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:17.875
I don't want to hear the ins and outs of grotting someone.

00:01:18.001 --> 00:01:19.041
Why?

00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:20.333
She's the best at murder.

00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:25.083
The youngest has never really gotten her life together.

00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:28.041
There's a wildness to them both that the others don't have.

00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:32.583
Remind me never to interrogate why
Bibi seems to be just naturally gifted at this.

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:36.000
Ursula has three kids, a very devoted husband.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.291
She's trying to keep lots of plates spinning.

00:01:38.291 --> 00:01:41.125
Grab your stuff and get in the car. You don't
need to take things off the table!

00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:42.458
Sort of highly strung at times.

00:01:44.959 --> 00:01:46.792
You don't really know who Grace is in a way.

00:01:46.792 --> 00:01:51.458
She has that odd veneer because she's in
so much denial about what's really happening.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.166
Get a grip of yourself.

00:01:53.542 --> 00:01:57.542
There's a lot of control inside the
relationship. There's a lot of gaslighting.

00:01:57.709 --> 00:02:02.542
He just can't deal with the fact that she's
part of this very strong group.

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:04.792
I mean nobody's out to get him in that sense.

00:02:04.792 --> 00:02:06.417
- No, baby they're not.
- I mean, no.

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:07.709
- Or are they?
- Well, I mean, 

00:02:07.709 --> 00:02:08.917
They are, now!

00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:11.792
Being both funny and sad,

00:02:11.792 --> 00:02:14.792
it has to be one of Sharon Horgan's greatest gifts.

00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:19.875
I always feel like comedy deals with
really serious topics really well.

00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:21.542
And it's so hard to act.

00:02:21.542 --> 00:02:22.208
Yeah!

00:02:24.083 --> 00:02:27.583
When we are all together, that's
when it just totally comes alive.

00:02:27.583 --> 00:02:28.291
Come on!

00:02:29.291 --> 00:02:31.250
It's pretty crazy at times.

00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:33.542
But there's a real beating heart at the center of it.

00:02:33.709 --> 00:02:35.417
We'll just look at for each other like we always have.

00:02:35.917 --> 00:02:38.208
They would do anything for each other.

00:02:39.542 --> 00:02:41.001
They would kill for each other.

00:02:45.709 --> 00:02:46.875
Families they're...

00:02:49.041 --> 00:02:50.208
complex.

